From 3780edcc024cd71c2773bb972cf8da2ce4167d80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oneplus6t-pmos-fixes <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:54:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: gadget: don't start a transfer on enable while End
 Transfer is delayed

When an endpoint is disabled while ep0 is not in SETUP phase, the End
Transfer is delayed (DWC3_EP_DELAY_STOP) and the disable keeps
DWC3_EP_DELAY_STOP and DWC3_EP_TRANSFER_STARTED. If the function driver
enables the endpoint again right away (u_ether eth_stop() does
usb_ep_disable() + usb_ep_enable() when the netdev is closed during an
NCM Set Interface), __dwc3_gadget_ep_enable() issues the no-op Start
Transfer while the old transfer is still active, and the controller
answers "No Resource". The following kicks fail the same way.

Skip the no-op Start Transfer in that case and set DWC3_EP_DELAY_START.
The delayed End Transfer is sent at the next SETUP stage, and its
completion clears DWC3_EP_TRANSFER_STARTED and kicks queued requests.

hardening.

---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c | 18 ++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
index 4c068c5f1..70226b96e 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
@@ -981,8 +982,17 @@ static int __dwc3_gadget_ep_enable(struct dwc3_ep *dep, unsigned int action)
 	/*
 	 * Issue StartTransfer here with no-op TRB so we can always rely on No
 	 * Response Update Transfer command.
+	 *
+	 * If the endpoint was disabled while its End Transfer was delayed
+	 * (DWC3_EP_DELAY_STOP, ep0 not in SETUP phase), the old transfer is
+	 * still active in the controller: a new Start Transfer now fails with
+	 * "No Resource". Skip it and let the delayed End Transfer run first;
+	 * its completion clears DWC3_EP_TRANSFER_STARTED and kicks any queued
+	 * requests through DWC3_EP_DELAY_START.
 	 */
-	if (usb_endpoint_xfer_bulk(desc) ||
+	if (dep->flags & DWC3_EP_DELAY_STOP) {
+		dep->flags |= DWC3_EP_DELAY_START;
+	} else if (usb_endpoint_xfer_bulk(desc) ||
 			usb_endpoint_xfer_int(desc)) {
 		struct dwc3_gadget_ep_cmd_params params;
 		struct dwc3_trb	*trb;
